{"seq":2,"slug":"language-models","title":"语言模型","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-lm","title":"统计语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/statistical-lm","wordCount":2098,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"neural-lm","title":"神经网络语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/neural-lm","wordCount":2241,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"llm-linguistics","title":"大语言模型与语言学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/llm-linguistics","wordCount":2396,"readingTime":10},{"seq":4,"slug":"parsing-syntax","title":"语法分析与句法模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/parsing-syntax","wordCount":1877,"readingTime":8},{"seq":5,"slug":"word-embeddings","title":"词嵌入与分布语义学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/word-embeddings","wordCount":2016,"readingTime":9},{"seq":6,"slug":"neural-lm","title":"神经语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/neural-lm","wordCount":1905,"readingTime":8},{"seq":7,"slug":"transformers-llm","title":"Transformer 与大语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/language-models/transformers-llm","wordCount":2013,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"语言模型-简介\">语言模型 简介</h1><p>本章追溯语言模型的技术演进历程，从统计方法到神经网络再到大语言模型，帮助读者理解语言建模的核心原理和当前技术前沿。</p>\n<p><strong>统计语言模型</strong>介绍 N-gram 模型和平滑技术等统计语言模型的数学基础，讲解困惑度等评价指标和数据稀疏问题的处理方法。</p>\n<p><strong>神经网络语言模型</strong>讲解从词向量到循环神经网络再到 Transformer 架构的技术演进，分析注意力机制和自回归生成的核心原理。</p>\n<p><strong>大语言模型与语言学</strong>探讨大语言模型的涌现能力、训练方法和对语言学研究的影响，分析 LLM 在语言理解和生成方面的能力与局限。</p>\n<p>建议读者按技术演进的时间线学习，理解每一代模型解决了什么问题又引入了什么新挑战。</p>\n"}